      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "id": "007",
      "startSec": 44,
      "endSec": 51,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/007.wav",
      "text": "写入前，每条候选先过质检。GC 失衡，合成和读取都会变难。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 6.640041666666667
    },
    {
      "id": "008",
      "startSec": 51,
      "endSec": 58,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/008.wav",
      "text": "第二关看同一字母是否连得太长。长串 A，设备容易读错。",
