      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/022.wav",
      "text": "同一位置的多条读段，还要做局部比对。动态规划矩阵展示的，就是这一小块相似关系。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 7.2000416666666665
    },
    {
      "id": "023",
      "startSec": 179,
      "endSec": 188,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/023.wav",
      "text": "对齐以后，每一列都有几种候选。质量更高的读段，投下更亮的权重。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 6.32
    },
    {
      "id": "024",
      "startSec": 188,
      "endSec": 198,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/024.wav",
      "text": "按列取共识，缺口就从多条证据的交集里补回来。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "id": "025",
      "startSec": 198,
      "endSec": 207,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/025.wav",
      "text": "外层纠错再补最后一层余量：编码负责写入前，局部比对和共识负责读回后。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 7.2000416666666665
    },
    {
      "id": "026",
      "startSec": 207,
      "endSec": 216,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/026.wav",
      "text": "生信算法的价值，就是把杂乱的短读段，变成可以核对的文件证据。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 5.84
    },
    {
      "id": "027",
      "startSec": 216,
      "endSec": 225,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/027.wav",
      "text": "那大模型能帮哪一步？它先把 DNA 看成一串 token，而不是一句自然语言。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 6.000041666666666
    },
    {
      "id": "028",
      "startSec": 225,
      "endSec": 235,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/028.wav",
      "text": "模型可以给候选序列打分，提示哪一段更可能在这次实验里出错，也能检索论文和调用约束检查器。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 8.720041666666667
    },
    {
      "id": "029",
      "startSec": 235,
      "endSec": 245,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/029.wav",
      "text": "它还可以观察读回结果，提出下一轮候选，把筛选变成一个会回看的闭环。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 6.000041666666666
    },
    {
      "id": "030",
      "startSec": 245,
      "endSec": 254,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/030.wav",
      "text": "但模型不能凭空替代纠错码，也不能保证一条序列一定合成成功。",
      "status": "ok",
      "seconds": 5.44
    },
    {
      "id": "031",
      "startSec": 254,
      "endSec": 262,
      "file": "D:/python_project/manim_extend_rainbow/video_project/dna_storage_algorithms/v2/public/audio/raw/031.wav",
      "text": "预测可以加快筛选，证据仍要回到编码器、合成仪和测序仪。",
